<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20263" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hărundĭnĕus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ar-</span></b> ), a,
		um, adj.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Of reeds</i>, <i>reedy</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">silva,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 10, 710</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">paniculae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					8, 32, 50, § 117</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cuneoli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					4, 29, 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ripae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 6, 174</span></i>
			.—<b>Poet.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carmen,</span>”
				<i>a shepherd's song</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Tr. 4, 1, 12</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Like a reed</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">radix,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					24, 16, 93, § 150</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mensura aurea,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Apoc. 21, 15</span></i>
			.</div>
